  "category": "games",
  "description": "Five turns. Keep yourself and the beacon alive. Enemies show where they will strike, so study the marks, move out of danger, or shove an attacker into a pit. Tap a neighboring tile or choose a move with the buttons. Nothing moves until you act, and the whole battlefield fits on one screen.\n\nSave and exit to continue later.\n\nFor Pebble Time 2 and Round 2. Touch requires firmware 4.33.2 or later; buttons remain available. By Luke Steuber.",
  "releaseNotes": "Round results now explain the outcome and show totals. Replay takes one deliberate press or tap; unfinished games still ask before restarting.",
